From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OG OS <og-os@invalid>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:41:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] zed_og: The Zed editor for Android

A cdylib entry point that runs the editor on gpui_android without network, AI,
collaboration, terminal or language-server features, with settings and key bindings
for a phone (Back, a docked project panel, the search bar) and codes-only logging.
